-- Sovietski: the full conversion Canine and Bear Cyborgs, WB36 Enhanced Cybernetic Animals with no WB17 counterpart, held as new rows (printed 150-155).
-- 2 vehicle rows, with 10 locations and 6 weapon entries.
--
